{"id":"vod_sn_85206","vodId":"85206","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"亚刻奥特曼日语","name_cn":"亚刻奥特曼日语","date":"2024-01-01","year":"2024","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全29集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20240629-1/c5b377a417c2d5175d4a57584529b79a.jpg"},"summary":"故事的发生地是在一座名为星元市的小城市。\r\n　　在市内的狮子尾山上，耸立着一个闪耀着彩色光芒的巨大物体，这个被命名为“摩诺之角”的物体，实际上是16年前“怪兽之日”事件发生之后就矗立在那里的“怪兽的角”。\r\n　　在世界各地同时出现怪兽的“怪兽之日”事件发生之后，怪兽灾害开始变得日常。日本的地球防卫队开始以武力对付怪兽的同时，怪兽防灾科学调查所（统称SKIP Scientific Kaiju Investigation and Prevention center）也为了防止怪兽灾害的发生和受灾情况扩大，不断对各地区进行科学调查和避难引导。这个组织时至今日，还在不停地调查“怪兽之日”出现的原因和城市中的“摩诺之角”。\r\n　　年仅7岁的“优马”在狮子尾山与父母露营时，遭遇了怪兽袭击，他奇迹般地生还并毫发无伤。以此为契机，“优马”踏上了研究怪兽生物学的道路。虽然有着痛苦的过去...","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-01-18 10:17:20","playable":true,"episodeCount":29,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v5.rstu6.com/202406/29/PMmt4wWUvD7/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v11.rstu6.com/202407/06/3KWJYPL9Nx3/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v9.rstu6.com/202407/13/GnYTQHCK9T18/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v9.rstu6.com/202407/20/1LFVdygEYi18/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v8.rstu6.com/202407/27/b9zAWsHhjE14/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v12.rstu6.com/202408/03/PYaLFGSdSL8/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v11.rstu6.com/202408/10/karyhGQLxL3/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v12.rstu6.com/202408/17/sURFFNynXy8/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v11.rstu6.com/202408/24/sMqBzk7Ynm3/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v12.rstu6.com/202408/31/iyW937iPTn8/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v5.rstu6.com/202409/07/BafX1z8G9R7/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v12.rstu6.com/202409/14/TxuXwURiEq8/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v12.rstu6.com/202409/21/DhdK4Yv6N58/vide